# Blastoids (formation 45) copy themselves: EnemyData's technique 12 is
# EnemyTechniqueTable's loc_2F6C. Once one of the three is dead, a
# Blastoid whose turn rolls under its rate (153) copies itself -- object
# and stats -- into the dead slot before it, or failing that the one
# after, and ObjEnmBattle_Dead brings the copy in when the script's hit
# lands. Before build 68 the port treated it as an attack, so a dead
# Blastoid stayed dead.

start battle 45
party 3 35
wait idle                    # FIGHT / STGY
shot 01_three_blastoids
press c                      # FIGHT, and the rounds run on
wait ticks 12400                # tick 12509: the left one dead and gone
shot 02_one_down
state
wait ticks 470                  # 12980: the copy in its slot, 43 HP like its source
shot 03_the_copy
state
limit 20000
wait idle
expect enemy-joined
expect script $1211          # "{char} and party are victorious!"
expect no-stderr not ported
